# Legacy Cursor rule: prefer .cursor/rules/curbi.mdc for new projects.
Use the reviewed cases.json policy. Run node --test after reply or policy changes.
Report observed results; network/schema errors are failures, not passes.
Never invent completed provider records. A pass grants no permission and does
not prove provider completion. Keep private data and keys out of fixtures.
The runner sends fixtures to https://api.curbi.io/v1/check.
These are assistant instructions, not tool interception or an authorization gate.
